				"{\n  \"video_prompt\": \"A continuous 15-second cinematic sequence starting from the provided image. Shot 1 (0-3s): Slow push in on the centerpiece of 'Braised Lion Head Goose Set Meal', showcasing the entire composition: the plate of glistening red-brown braised goose meat, golden fried tofu, green vegetables, a bowl of soup, white rice, dipping sauce, and the decorative red chilies on the blue-and-white patterned tablecloth. Shot 2 (3-6s): Extreme macro close-up on a piece of succulent goose meat, highlighting the deep lacquered sheen of the braising sauce, the tender, pull-apart texture of the meat, and a few drops of glossy sauce clinging to the surface. Shot 3 (6-9s): Camera tilts up slightly from the feast, revealing a soft, warm, and slightly out-of-focus retro neon sign glowing in the deep background, spelling the Pinyin 'LAO ER' in a classic style. Shot 4 (9-12s): A slow orbit shot around the main plate of goose, as dynamic, warm light—simulating the flicker of a hidden lantern or kitchen fire—dances and shifts across the meat, casting long, stylized shadows and enhancing the feeling of rich, savory aroma. Shot 5 (12-15s): Pull back to a wide shot that matches the original image's rich composition, now showing the entire, generous 'set meal' in its full context on the traditional table setting, creating an inviting and satisfying dining scene. 4k, hyper-realistic, Wong Kar-wai style lighting with dramatic color saturation and contrast.\",\n  \"audio_script\": \"看看这油光发亮的狮头鹅！这肉卤得也太到位了，皮糯肉烂，入口即化！卤汁的咸香全渗进去了，配着这碗靓汤和米饭，一口下去大满足！想吃最地道的潮汕风味？快来‘老二蘇南澄海狮头鹅’，保证你回味无穷！\",\n  \"overlay_text\": \"老二蘇南澄海狮头鹅\"\n}"
